{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30004_01_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:450a935775bca1508ad4abfe59c5f5547a46a8c9b5cc431c1181f0cf92aa9f12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb1978d389b7e6f6fb508fa1c55eec4ffd8e9b12c3b738e8dbb623acde66a3c",
      "text": "哇啊——！\n没想到主角居然会变成这样啊——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eedef0a455fc64e99609e65478e51873b7a847ec81107c60bf66ba8a6d5f4847",
      "text": "呐呐，享介。台本你读到哪里了？\n这里的剧情展开，是不是超绝？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aaa7a0e708dadf552c3ac0abf24b29141ee82e52f77d03ca419a50fd0b6c481b",
      "text": "知道了，知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7ee52367d1598863d4ee6d02d0d9de2c650807e1a9b0c08f0b18c3839bf1af1",
      "text": "拿到《明日转》的台本会很兴奋我能理解，\n但你再冷静一点啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6519b0294638fa4a14d0417ddbf6800d5c00c0e24782b30f958c819a8c2f8668",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉。\n可是真的太有趣了嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d136b3ebd596c304001c6b3237ca758e12a687f22fc9cbe93f483d09d44382ba",
      "text": "我懂的。挑战当勇者的烦恼描绘得非常细致，\n让人不由自主地被吸引进故事里呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d1a4357f5ca88a64f9e4b93b56c9103a29648aaeb76a4b8910e5a307b69493",
      "text": "就是说啊！\n一直在想接下来会怎样，完全看入迷了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a52a91ab665f51d3a55e48a7bbc110f199a4f498ef0416006a683f6c50f4c358",
      "text": "无论对谁来说，迈出新的一步\n都是需要勇气的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ea0be98ab5ce737662901be357cc60acfcab82428c6ca0af74dca5ea3b80276",
      "text": "嗯！为了改变自己的世界而不断努力的\n主角真的好厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30004_01:1_3_30004_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707891fa371c660cd21fed11e1299f8812d215d62e9cf29599f5246b990425b1",
      "text": "（……改变世界，吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
